    .. math::
        loss(x, y) = - \frac{1}{C} * \sum_i y[i] * \log((1 + \exp(-x[i]))^{-1})
                         + (1-y[i]) * \log\left(\frac{\exp(-x[i])}{(1 + \exp(-x[i]))}\right)

    where :math:`i \in \left\{0, \; \cdots , \; \text{x.nElement}() - 1\right\}`,
    :math:`y[i] \in \left\{0, \; 1\right\}`.

